WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:04.960
<i>It's been raining all the time lately.
I can't remember the last blue sky.</i>

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.760
Thank you.
I look forward to working with you again.

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:13.390
<i>What are you thinking
when you look at the sky...</i>

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.180
<i>so dark gray that it's as if it's been blocked off?</i>

00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:52.570
hug 12 mi tesoro

00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:53.690
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:01:54.940 --> 00:01:56.280
Mr. Sasaki.

00:01:56.650 --> 00:02:01.740
All right, we renewed the contract again
this year for the Takane commercials.

00:02:01.910 --> 00:02:04.370
Thank you for seeing him, Takato.

00:02:04.660 --> 00:02:11.420
Well, after that article came out,
I wanted to apologize to President Takane.

00:02:11.420 --> 00:02:15.260
Yes, although he said he didn't care about that.

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:16.090
So we're good.

00:02:17.510 --> 00:02:18.800
Sorry.

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:25.390
Sure is coming down.

00:02:25.930 --> 00:02:27.230
By the way, Takato...

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:30.060
we're having octopus dumplings
at my house tonight.

00:02:31.230 --> 00:02:33.360
Here you go, Nana!

00:02:34.360 --> 00:02:37.570
Thank you! You're good at this, Takato!

00:02:38.030 --> 00:02:39.950
Really?

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:42.910
This is great! They look delicious!

00:02:44.410 --> 00:02:47.500
Nana, you're wearing that hair ornament.

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:52.750
Yeah! I love everything you give me, Takato.

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:53.590
Thunk!

00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:56.840
Nana, I'll make the next batch
of dumplings right away!

00:02:54.920 --> 00:02:56.840
She's got you wrapped around her finger.

00:02:57.090 --> 00:03:00.140
Papa, don't talk like I'm a bad woman.

00:03:00.140 --> 00:03:01.550
That's right, Mr. Sasaki.

00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:04.970
She's inherited her brilliant public relations
skills from her former idol mother.

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:08.520
Taku, I finished the side dishes.
Would you take them over?

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:09.770
Coming.

00:03:10.810 --> 00:03:13.610
Taku, wait. Would you sample this first?

00:03:13.980 --> 00:03:15.610
Is it too salty?

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:17.490
Let's see.

00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:19.570
It's good.

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:21.450
<i>Takato.</i>

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:22.370
<i>Takato!</i>

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:25.080
Would you sample this?

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:25.910
Sure.

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:27.870
Here. Open wide.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:30.830
Taka... Takato?

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:33.790
What's wrong?

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:35.800
Nothing.

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:37.800
Okay, let's keep grilling!

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:41.300
Takato, you look lonely.

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:43.850
Nana.

00:03:45.390 --> 00:03:47.640
I'll be fine.

00:03:53.810 --> 00:03:55.270
She's fast asleep.

00:03:56.440 --> 00:03:57.690
Oof.

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:04.030
Nana was so happy,
since she hadn't seen you in a while.

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:05.780
She was in high spirits.

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:09.620
I notice that Mr. Sasaki
only wears his wedding ring at home.

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:13.880
That's right. He said
he'd be worried about losing it outside.

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:17.050
Taku has a tendency to lose things.

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:20.260
What is it like wearing a ring?

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:21.970
What kind of question is that?

00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:26.430
After you quit show business, Rina,
you and Mr. Sasaki became a couple,

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:28.810
and now you're wearing a wedding ring.

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:31.770
I was wondering what that's like.

00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:35.270
Determination, I guess.

00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:37.320
Determination?

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:41.530
Yes. The determination to be happy with him.

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:44.450
I think that's what I felt
when I first put this on.

00:04:45.530 --> 00:04:47.950
The determination to be happy.

00:04:49.370 --> 00:04:50.660
Takato?

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:53.790
Ri. I've got this.

00:04:53.790 --> 00:04:55.380
Oh, right.

00:04:57.090 --> 00:05:00.010
Well, why don't we have another drink or two?

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:06.050
Mr. Sasaki. I'm sure you've picked up
on my relationship with him.

00:05:06.930 --> 00:05:07.760
Yeah.

00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:11.310
I told him we were breaking up.

00:05:11.980 --> 00:05:17.150
During my 20 years as an actor,
I've never really been attracted to anyone.

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:19.980
That's why I want to protect his talent.

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:22.820
Even if that is my ego talking.

00:05:23.190 --> 00:05:24.030
Yeah.

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:29.580
I was determined to steer clear of him,
even if he bore a grudge against me for it.

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:32.200
I was determined...

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:37.380
but I wasn't mentally prepared
to be separated from him.

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:46.430
The thing about choices
is you don't have to make just one.

00:05:47.970 --> 00:05:52.270
Try being a little more honest with yourself
and just a tad greedy.

00:05:52.640 --> 00:05:55.390
Whatever path you go down,
I'll be there to find the work

00:05:55.390 --> 00:05:59.270
that's the most fitting
for the Takato Saijo at the time...

00:05:59.810 --> 00:06:02.150
and of course Taguchi is a real go-getter.

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:08.160
I think you've become even more charming
after meeting Azumaya.

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:10.490
Mr. Sasaki.

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:15.580
I hope it stops raining soon.

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:25.800
Oh.

00:06:29.890 --> 00:06:32.350
Thanks for doing this for me, Yurie.

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:34.930
Sure, sure.
How could I refuse those puppy-dog eyes?

00:06:36.140 --> 00:06:38.400
Excuse me, Saijo.

00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:39.690
Have a good day.

00:06:44.530 --> 00:06:45.400
Not getting on?

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:56.750
<i>The mood in here is oppressive.</i>

00:06:57.870 --> 00:07:02.380
<i>But I haven't been this close to him
in a long time.</i>

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:05.130
<i>If I reached out my arm, I would touch him.</i>

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:10.090
<i>Is he using those big hands
on someone other than me?</i>

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:13.600
<i>Is he making love with Yurie Kurokawa?</i>

00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:16.350
Do you think I'm going to do something?

00:07:18.890 --> 00:07:20.690
You have this hungry look on your face.

00:07:21.560 --> 00:07:23.860
Who looks like that?!

00:07:24.690 --> 00:07:25.530
That's...

00:07:28.570 --> 00:07:30.200
I don't have that look on my face.

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:38.910
What are you doing?

00:07:40.120 --> 00:07:45.460
How about you? It's no fair for you to have
that expression after breaking up with me.

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:50.880
Chun...

00:07:54.760 --> 00:07:56.350
Excuse me.

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:01.100
<i>Idiot.</i>

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:05.360
<i>I'm an idiot.</i>

00:08:05.820 --> 00:08:08.360
<i>I was hoping he would embrace me.</i>

00:08:15.330 --> 00:08:16.990
Okay!

00:08:16.990 --> 00:08:20.120
Ms. Kurokawa and Azumaya,
we've got all your scenes!

00:08:20.120 --> 00:08:23.040
And that's a wrap for this series.

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:23.920
Good work!

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:26.710
Thank you. Great job, everyone.

00:08:26.960 --> 00:08:28.920
Great job, Yurie.

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:33.890
Sheesh. You're the only one here who still
looks like he's heading for the crucial scene.

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:37.760
You're a bad boy with an angelic face.

00:08:38.390 --> 00:08:42.770
Junta, the media is on standby outside,
and they're totally psyched.

00:08:43.270 --> 00:08:47.190
Thanks. I feel bad for roping you in, too,
Narumiya, but I appreciate it.

00:08:47.900 --> 00:08:49.730
Leave it to me!

00:08:50.070 --> 00:08:52.990
And now the finishing touch.

00:08:53.990 --> 00:08:55.280
TOBUN'S FALSE REPORT!!

00:08:55.280 --> 00:08:56.780
WEEKLY HOUSEWIFE

00:08:55.410 --> 00:08:56.780
TOBUN'S FALSE REPORT!!
FOOLED BY AN ACTOR'S
PERFORMANCE!!

00:08:56.030 --> 00:09:00.040
It looks like the story about Azumaya
and Yurie Kuro was fake news.

00:08:57.370 --> 00:08:58.910
ACTOR FOOLS THE TOBUN
COMPLETELY FABRICATED

00:08:58.910 --> 00:09:00.040
SECRET LOVE AFFAIR BETWEEN THE TWO REALLY
A HOAX CONCOCTED BY THEM AND CREW

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:03.250
The drama's official blog and Ryo's SNS
has photos of the whole cast

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:07.750
taken at the same place as that photo scoop.

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:07.710
I WENT TO A CAFE WITH THE STAFF
AND MISS YURIE
AND JUNTA TREATED US!!
SUPER HAPPY!!
ARE THESE TWO A GODDESS AND AN ARCHANGEL?!?!?!
OH, I BORROWED THE SUNGLASSES FROM MS. YURIE~!

00:09:08.170 --> 00:09:10.420
The "Tobun" totally blew it.

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:15.010
Now we'll never know
if romantic photos of Takato are real.

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:18.050
Smooth move by Azumaya.

00:09:19.220 --> 00:09:22.020
The "Tobun" is getting slagged.

00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:24.850
Fake news can take a publication down.

00:09:24.850 --> 00:09:27.650
I bet the staff of "Tobun"
are crapping their pants.

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:30.280
What is he thinking?

00:09:30.780 --> 00:09:33.110
He's probably got one thing on his mind.

00:09:34.110 --> 00:09:37.870
Oh, yeah, I heard they're doing PR today
for the final episode of "Witch's Drip."

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:45.040
<i>From the drama "Witch's Drip," we have
with us Yurie Kurokawa and Junta Azumaya.</i>

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:47.420
There he is.

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:51.050
<i>The two of you have prepared
for the role of lovers,</i>

00:09:51.050 --> 00:09:54.010
<i>and in the final episode,
we'll see if that pays off.</i>

00:09:54.300 --> 00:09:56.630
I can't wait to see it tonight.

00:09:56.630 --> 00:09:58.970
Thanks to extensive rehearsing
with Ms. Kurokawa,

00:09:58.970 --> 00:10:01.850
we filmed a final episode
that should really satisfy the audience.

00:10:01.850 --> 00:10:04.390
I hope everyone sees it.

00:10:04.730 --> 00:10:09.310
Both of your performances
even fooled the media.

00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:13.400
We weren't intending
to trick anyone, though. Right?

00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:14.900
No, not at all.

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:18.370
By the way,
I'd like to make an announcement.

00:10:18.370 --> 00:10:19.200
What is it?

00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:22.370
The "Tobun’s" previous scoop,
the photo of Takato Saijo,

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:24.790
I was the other person in the picture.

00:10:28.830 --> 00:10:31.590
Mr. Saijo happened to miss
his footing on the stairs,

00:10:31.590 --> 00:10:33.550
and I just supported him so he wouldn't fall.

00:10:33.550 --> 00:10:36.840
Mr. Saijo seems suave,
but he's actually pretty clumsy.

00:10:36.840 --> 00:10:39.010
When we worked together before,

00:10:39.010 --> 00:10:42.310
I once saw him stumble
over a piece of machinery in the corner.

00:10:42.310 --> 00:10:45.060
He's more absent-minded
than his image suggests, but that's cute.

00:10:45.060 --> 00:10:47.140
R-Really?

00:10:47.140 --> 00:10:51.020
That's surprising
and is kind of a scoop on its own.

00:10:51.020 --> 00:10:54.780
Incidentally, Mr. Saijo and I have plans
to move in with each other soon.

00:10:55.820 --> 00:10:57.740
You mean you two, um...

00:10:58.410 --> 00:11:03.240
As an actor, there's no one
I admire more than Mr. Saijo.

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:05.500
I want to learn all I can from him
right by his side.

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:07.540
Th-That makes sense!

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:09.290
That's wonderful!

00:11:15.590 --> 00:11:18.430
I definitely don't want
to make an enemy out of that bastard.

00:11:18.430 --> 00:11:20.260
AFTER LEAVING THE AFTER-PARTY RESTAURANT,
A DRUNK SAIJO STEALS ANOTHER STAFF MEMBER'S
SWEATER AND TRIES TO GO HOME

00:11:19.430 --> 00:11:24.010
But if this is the deal, then maybe I'll join in.

00:11:20.260 --> 00:11:24.010
POST

00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:30.850
CLUMSY

00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:30.850
JUNTA AZUMAYA
TOBUN ADMITS ERROR

00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:30.850
RECOMMENDED TRENDS
TAKATO SAIJO

00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:34.860
That jackass. Who is he calling clumsy?

00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:37.570
Now everyone who's ever worked with you

00:11:37.570 --> 00:11:42.120
is tweeting their stories
of "Takato's clumsiest moments."

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:44.530
Even Mr. Nakata.

00:11:45.580 --> 00:11:49.290
It's fine.
It looks like you're more popular than ever.

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:51.000
I'M IN LOVE WITH HIM ALL OVER AGAIN!

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:51.000
CLUMSY TAKATO IS CUTE

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:50.420
Take a look.

00:11:51.290 --> 00:11:53.080
So what should we do?

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:56.170
He got the drop on you
by announcing you're going to live together.

00:11:58.510 --> 00:12:01.340
Mr. Sasaki, I want to go to a certain shop.

00:12:01.340 --> 00:12:02.180
A shop?

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:06.680
Prepare yourself. I'm going
to show you something, so be ready.

00:12:08.560 --> 00:12:09.850
I see.

00:12:12.310 --> 00:12:13.980
We were screwed over, huh?

00:12:14.360 --> 00:12:16.650
Yes. We certainly were.

00:12:17.110 --> 00:12:21.320
Because of this,
people will lose trust in me and you, too.

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:27.290
I've especially got a lot of enemies, so I'm
sure they'll take advantage of this to strike.

00:12:27.290 --> 00:12:29.120
I'm sorry, Mr. Tabe.

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:31.830
I don't blame you.

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:34.290
He was clever.

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:38.760
And I don't think you're cut out
for this sleazy line of work, Hase.

00:12:39.380 --> 00:12:42.590
I thought it suited me.

00:12:43.220 --> 00:12:48.390
I know an editor of an art magazine
who's looking for a good photographer.

00:12:48.390 --> 00:12:50.520
He's a decent guy, so I'll introduce you.

00:12:50.930 --> 00:12:52.480
What about you?

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:56.060
I'm about ready to take it easy myself,
so I'm thinking of getting off this ride

00:12:56.060 --> 00:12:59.570
and requesting a reassignment
to the food reporting bureau.

00:12:59.570 --> 00:13:01.700
That's where my real interest lies.

00:13:01.950 --> 00:13:03.030
Mr. Tabe...

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:07.200
thank you for all of your help.

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:14.830
If you ever do a solo exhibition, invite me.

00:13:20.210 --> 00:13:23.630
Takato Saijo and Junta Azumaya.

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:26.180
I really want to get a shot of you two.

00:13:31.850 --> 00:13:34.020
Here's your ring back.

00:13:34.270 --> 00:13:37.730
I apologize for getting you involved in my plan.

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:40.360
To me, it wasn't "your plan."

00:13:40.610 --> 00:13:44.950
I'm an actress. I'll do anything
to draw attention to my work.

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:48.410
Ms. Kurokawa,
it's been an honor to perform with you.

00:13:49.030 --> 00:13:53.750
If you talk like that, your boyfriend
right behind you will get jealous.

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:58.250
What are you doing here?

00:13:59.340 --> 00:14:02.210
- I came here to pick you up!
- Pick me up?

00:14:02.510 --> 00:14:04.170
- Azumaya.
- Yes?

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:08.550
If you really want to wear a ring someday,
I'll be around.

00:14:08.550 --> 00:14:11.220
Maybe next time we'll put it on your left hand?

00:14:11.220 --> 00:14:12.100
No.

00:14:14.270 --> 00:14:19.190
I've got a contract with all of this guy's fingers,
not just this one.

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:22.030
Well, how greedy.

00:14:22.570 --> 00:14:25.110
I've made up my mind.
I'm determined to be greedy.

00:14:25.700 --> 00:14:27.570
Takato.

00:14:28.160 --> 00:14:29.870
Let's go home, Chunta.

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:36.620
Hey! We're still by the front door!

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:41.130
Chunta! Wai–

00:14:44.840 --> 00:14:48.590
Without you, this room was just a box.

00:14:49.090 --> 00:14:53.810
You made an unholy deal
with that cameraman, didn't you?

00:14:54.390 --> 00:14:56.770
You're just as unholy!

00:14:56.770 --> 00:14:58.900
You might as well have been selling yourself!

00:14:58.900 --> 00:15:00.860
When I was trying to protect you!

00:15:01.230 --> 00:15:03.650
I turned the tables on you.

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:07.280
In the first place,
I never said I wanted you to protect me.

00:15:07.610 --> 00:15:08.530
What?!

00:15:09.110 --> 00:15:14.540
Did you really think I would be satisfied
if you got hurt on my behalf?

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:16.200
I didn't have a choice!

00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:20.130
I couldn't let your talent
be dragged through the mud!

00:15:20.130 --> 00:15:21.040
You don't get it.

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:21.880
Get what?!

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:30.010
You may care about my talent,
but you're everything to me, Takato Saijo!

00:15:30.010 --> 00:15:33.470
E-Everything. That's...

00:15:33.810 --> 00:15:36.680
Takato, you changed me.

00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:39.230
I didn't do anything.

00:15:40.020 --> 00:15:43.860
It isn't fair that you made me
into the man I am, but don't even realize it.

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:45.820
What the hell?

00:15:46.400 --> 00:15:49.070
What the hell? You're the one who isn't fair.

00:15:49.070 --> 00:15:52.200
I wasn't... I wasn't like this before.

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:55.080
You changed me.

00:15:56.870 --> 00:15:58.080
Show me your face.

00:15:58.710 --> 00:15:59.750
No.

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:02.710
Look at me, and tell me the truth.

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:06.460
Did you have sex with...

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:09.630
Did you have sex with Yurie Kurokawa?!

00:16:10.430 --> 00:16:11.470
Takato.

00:16:12.010 --> 00:16:13.550
I hated the idea!

00:16:13.850 --> 00:16:16.350
I hated the thought of you
with anyone but me!

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:20.480
The truth is I hated
that you weren't by my side!

00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:22.650
The truth... The truth is...

00:16:23.150 --> 00:16:25.900
I didn't want to break up.

00:16:27.150 --> 00:16:28.230
Please live...

00:16:30.150 --> 00:16:31.860
with me forever.

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:41.330
I'll do whatever I have to do
to make sure we stay together.

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:43.040
I told you that before, didn't I?

00:16:43.040 --> 00:16:45.540
When we run away, when we fight,
we'll do it together.

00:16:45.750 --> 00:16:46.960
Chun...

00:16:46.960 --> 00:16:50.800
So please don't ever leave me again.

00:16:54.220 --> 00:16:58.850
Regarding Ms. Kurokawa,
she only helped me with my plan.

00:16:58.850 --> 00:17:01.140
We didn't have any kind
of romantic entanglement.

00:17:01.690 --> 00:17:04.940
You're the only one I want to make love to.

00:17:04.940 --> 00:17:06.980
I wanted to put my hands on you so badly.

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:09.820
Me, too, Chunta.

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:13.530
<i>I wanted you to touch me.</i>

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:21.370
<i>Say, I wonder what happened to the flowers
we picked on that desert island.</i>

00:17:22.540 --> 00:17:27.790
<i>Did one get left behind on the beach,
while the other was swept away by a wave?</i>

00:17:29.300 --> 00:17:31.340
<i>No. I'm sure...</i>

00:17:32.010 --> 00:17:33.430
<i>I'm sure they're together.</i>

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:36.090
No.

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:39.680
Stay here a little longer.

00:17:41.810 --> 00:17:43.560
We'll continue this in bed.

00:17:50.780 --> 00:17:52.820
Takato is in my bed.

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:54.530
<i>He's radiant.</i>

00:17:55.660 --> 00:17:56.490
Idiot.

00:17:58.830 --> 00:18:03.750
<i>I see. It stopped raining.</i>

00:18:16.130 --> 00:18:18.260
<i>Um, where's my...</i>

00:18:19.550 --> 00:18:20.510
There!

00:18:28.230 --> 00:18:30.150
These are a couple's rings.

00:18:30.730 --> 00:18:32.110
You were awake?

00:18:32.570 --> 00:18:33.530
I was.

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:34.990
Really?

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:36.990
Takato, thank you.

00:18:36.990 --> 00:18:39.570
I'll treasure this my whole life.
No, even after I die.

00:18:39.570 --> 00:18:41.160
Don't exaggerate.

00:18:41.160 --> 00:18:43.700
And don't wear it outside much.

00:18:43.870 --> 00:18:46.830
Huh? Come to think of it,
I'm surprised you knew my size.

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:50.380
Oh, no, I just guessed.

00:18:50.380 --> 00:18:51.920
Luckily, it fits perfectly.

00:18:53.090 --> 00:18:57.840
<i>Of course I knew. After all the times
that hand has touched me...</i>

00:18:57.840 --> 00:18:58.760
I've got it!

00:18:59.590 --> 00:19:02.600
Lend me your ring for just a little bit, Takato.

00:19:03.680 --> 00:19:04.520
Okay.

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:06.640
Wait there for a few minutes.

00:19:08.520 --> 00:19:10.230
Wh-What?!

00:19:14.030 --> 00:19:15.320
- Finished!
- Finished what?!

00:19:15.900 --> 00:19:17.860
I engraved it.

00:19:19.450 --> 00:19:21.410
What does it say?

00:19:22.120 --> 00:19:24.160
"Mi tesoro."

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:27.460
The meaning is a secret.

00:19:27.830 --> 00:19:30.170
S-Secret.

00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:33.210
You're a man with too many mysteries!

00:19:33.210 --> 00:19:35.170
You even got the better of the "Tobun."

00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:36.630
Well, I couldn't forgive them.

00:19:37.010 --> 00:19:39.840
I'm the only one
who gets to take peeping photos of you.

00:19:39.840 --> 00:19:41.850
SNEAK PHOTOGRAPHY IS NEVER OKAY!!

00:19:39.840 --> 00:19:43.390
I'm surprised you can say that
with a straight face, you stalking angel!

00:19:46.810 --> 00:19:47.980
What's this?

00:19:48.440 --> 00:19:49.850
JIRO HASEGAWA INVESTIGATION FILE

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:51.810
MR. HASEGAWA LIKES CREAM BUNS
MORE THAN MELON BUNS

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:51.810
BACK ALLEY BAR

00:19:52.110 --> 00:19:53.230
Scary.

00:19:54.610 --> 00:19:56.740
Well, I think they learned their lesson.

00:19:57.030 --> 00:20:00.450
I don't know, but I think
you're scarier than any of them.

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:07.080
USAKA

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:09.370
Mr. Usaka?

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:14.750
It seems you covered for yourself.

00:20:15.550 --> 00:20:20.340
Unfortunately, a replacement for Saijo's role in
the sequel to "Midday Star" hasn't been decided.

00:20:20.340 --> 00:20:21.220
Then...

00:20:22.970 --> 00:20:26.510
Yes. I'm back to the original line of thinking.

00:20:27.180 --> 00:20:31.390
But although these recent incidents ended well,

00:20:31.390 --> 00:20:34.610
I'm sure it has had
a considerable effect on your image.

00:20:35.110 --> 00:20:39.530
So as a way for you two
to rehabilitate your image beforehand...

00:20:40.490 --> 00:20:42.410
I've prepared a job for you.

00:20:42.410 --> 00:20:43.240
A job?

00:20:44.320 --> 00:20:47.950
A two-man show
for Takato Saijo and Junta Azumaya.

00:20:50.080 --> 00:20:54.290
You'll show your abilities as actors
and silence any naysayers.

00:20:55.340 --> 00:20:56.250
Azumaya.

00:20:56.540 --> 00:20:58.050
Of course we'll do it.

00:20:59.340 --> 00:21:00.170
Then it's settled.

00:21:00.470 --> 00:21:02.680
I'll send the details later
to your offices.

00:21:17.020 --> 00:21:18.190
Huh?

00:21:19.530 --> 00:21:20.490
Usa!

00:21:20.780 --> 00:21:22.950
Arisu.

00:21:23.820 --> 00:21:24.950
Long time, no see.

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:26.620
AN ISLAND IN JUNE
6:00 PM ~ 4:00 AM

00:21:28.370 --> 00:21:31.620
We'll get serious about living together
after our play is a success.

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:33.000
Oh, come on!

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:35.420
This is no time for moving.

00:21:35.420 --> 00:21:37.040
We have to focus on the play!

00:21:37.040 --> 00:21:38.880
We need to nail this!

00:21:41.510 --> 00:21:44.090
Understood. We'll definitely make it a success!

00:21:45.140 --> 00:21:47.640
Your first play is a two-man show with me.

00:21:47.640 --> 00:21:48.850
I feel sorry for you.

00:21:49.220 --> 00:21:50.560
Bring it on.

00:21:50.930 --> 00:21:52.480
- I'm not gonna lose!
- I won't lose!

00:23:34.910 --> 00:23:40.000
hug 13
"fu-fu-fuuuun ♪"
